        "slug": "kirikiri-outreach-200-inmates",
        "summary": "Last month I visited Kirikiri and couldn’t sleep after. On July 19th we go back with hot food, toiletries and toothpaste for 200 inmates. Itemized below - vendors get paid, not me.",
